pe change.\n+2. Keep `MONDO:0957382` as the syndrome term and create or update a more specific `GCSH`-related glycine encephalopathy term under `glycine encephalopathy`.\n+\n+No ontology changes were committed pending clarification.\n\nIndex: /__w/eval-ont-agent-mondo/eval-ont-agent-mondo/PR_COMMENTS.md\n===================================================================\n--- /__w/eval-ont-agent-mondo/eval-ont-agent-mondo/PR_COMMENTS.md\n+++ /__w/eval-ont-agent-mondo/eval-ont-agent-mondo/PR_COMMENTS.md\n\n","files":[{"filePath":"/__w/eval-ont-agent-mondo/eval-ont-agent-mondo/ISSUE_COMMENTS.md","relativePath":"ISSUE_COMMENTS.md","type":"add","patch":"Index: /__w/eval-ont-agent-mondo/eval-ont-agent-mondo/ISSUE_COMMENTS.md\n===================================================================\n--- /__w/eval-ont-agent-mondo/eval-ont-agent-mondo/ISSUE_COMMENTS.md\n+++ /__w/eval-ont-agent-mondo/eval-ont-agent-mondo/ISSUE_COMMENTS.md\n@@ -0,0 +1,10 @@\n+This issue is not clear enough to curate yet.\n+\n+The requested label change targets `MONDO:0957382 multiple mitochondrial dysfunctions syndrome 7`, but the proposed replacement label `GCSH-related glycine encephalopathy` appears to narrow the scope and may instead correspond to a child of `MONDO:0011612 glycine encephalopathy`, as already noted in the issue discussion.\n+\n+Please clarify which concept should be represented:\n+\n+1. Rename `MONDO:0957382` to the ClinGen preferred label despite the apparent scope change.\n+2. Keep `MONDO:0957382` as the syndrome term and create or update a more specific `GCSH`-related glycine encephalopathy term under `glycine encephalopathy`.\n+\n+No ontology changes were committed pending clarification.\n","additions":10,"deletions":0},{"filePath":"/__w/eval-ont-agent-mondo/eval-ont-agent-mondo/PR_COMMENTS.md","relativePath":"PR_COMMENTS.md","type":"add","patch":"Index: /__w/eval-ont-agent-mondo/eval-ont-agent-mondo/PR_COMMENTS.md\n==========================================================